WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.900
Describe the graph one section at a time.

2
00:00:03.876 --> 00:00:07.676
From zero to two hours, the distance from home increases.

3
00:00:12.652 --> 00:00:16.827
From two to three hours it stays constant: the cyclist has stopped.

4
00:00:20.121 --> 00:00:23.696
From three to five hours it decreases, back to zero.
